<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian August unemployment steady at 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Austrian August unemployment steady at 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Social Affairs Ministry reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 August     July     August 1995</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce	4.1	  4.1	    4.6</p>
<p> Total			    189,899    186,821	180,284</p>
<p>NOTE - The August and July 1996 figures were calculated by the European Statistics Office, and are based on a 1995 census. The August 1995 figure was calculated by the Austrian Social Affairs Ministry based on a 1994 census and is not directly comparable.</p>
<p>Since December 1995, Austria has calculated percentage of workforce according to EU standards and all previous figures were calculated according to OECD standards.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +43 1 531 12 257</p>
</text>
